  "releaseNotes": "## Geotab MyAdmin API Release Notes - Version 1.1.95\n\n**Release Date:** April 13, 2025\n\nThis release includes the addition of a new property.\n\n* **`pxHubOpportunityId` Property Added:** The optional `pxHubOpportunityId` field has been added to the `ApiOrderHeader` object. This allows partners to associate their opportunity ID from the PX Hub to a MyAdmin order.\n\n## Geotab MyAdmin API Release Notes - Version 1.1.94\n\n**Release Date:** February 1, 2025\n\nDeprecations\n\nThis release includes the deprecation of an unused package.  No endpoints or parameters have been affected by this change.\n\n## Geotab MyAdmin API Release Notes - Version 1.1.89\n\n**Release Date:** October 19, 2024\n\nThis release includes the addition of a new property.\n### New Features\n\n* **RmaType Property Added:** The `RmaType` property has been added to the `ApiRma` object. Access device return information with our enhanced SDK. The ApiRma object now includes a dedicated property for the device return type (such as repair, warranty return, investigate, and more), making it readily available for your integrations. This improvement simplifies data retrieval and enables more efficient processing of returns..\n\n\n## Geotab MyAdmin API Release Notes - Version 1.1.87 \n\n**Release Date:** September 28, 2024\n\nThis release includes the deprecation/removal of an endpoint and parameter.\n### Deprecations and Removals\n\n* **`GetWarrantyOptions` Endpoint Deprecated:** The `GetWarrantyOptions` endpoint is now deprecated. Deprecated warrantyOptionId from the PostOrder method.\n* **`warrantyOptionId` Parameter Removed:** The `warrantyOptionId` integer parameter has been removed from the `ApiOrderHeader` object. Deprecated warrantyOptionId from the PostOrder method.\n\n* See a full list changes at https://developers.geotab.com/myAdmin/releaseNotes",
  "repository": "",
